{"title":"Ice Troll","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/troll-heart\">Troll Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ice-troll-brute\">Ice Troll Brute</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll\">Redrock Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\">Chalk Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper\">Troll Pitkeeper</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-shaman\">Troll Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-glutton\">Troll Glutton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll\">Barrow Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-king\">Troll King</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/9c3d5440ecd811b3cba0.svg\" alt=\"Ice Troll\"></div><h3>Ice Troll</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>20</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Troll</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>Not yet</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}